ork/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunner.java\"}","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunner.java"},"is_input_complete":true,"thought_signature":null}},{"ToolUse":{"id":"call_3ace0e5419dc41a0aff167e4","name":"Read src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessmentRequest.java","raw_input":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessmentRequest.java\"}","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessmentRequest.java"},"is_input_complete":true,"thought_signature":null}},{"Thinking":{"text":"Now let me read the two test files to understand the test conventions.","signature":null}},{"ToolUse":{"id":"call_031acf3198b44e7c9337b312","name":"Read src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java","raw_input":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java\"}","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java"},"is_input_complete":true,"thought_signature":null}},{"ToolUse":{"id":"call_6d2c3303d46d488aa69b563e","name":"Read src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java","raw_input":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java\"}","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java"},"is_input_complete":true,"thought_signature":null}},{"Thinking":{"text":"I now have a solid understanding of the implementation. Let me verify the calculation for AC-2:\n\n- Common capital:20,000 USDT- Simple earn APR:0.0365,90 days- Simple earn90-day income =20000 ×0.0365 ×90/365 =20000 ×0.0365 =730;730 ×90/365 =730 ×0.246575... =180. Yes,180 USDT.\n- Full known cost:20 USDT- Hedged notional:10,000 USDT- Threshold = (180 +20) /10000 =200/10000 =0.02 (2%). ✓Incremental at cumulative rate r: fundingIncome =10000 × r; net =10000×r −20; incremental = net −180 =10000×r −200.\n- r =0.019:190 −200 = −10 ✓- r =0.020:200 −200 =0 ✓- r =0.021:210 −200 =10 ✓Good, consistent with the existing formula in PhaseOneAssessmentService: threshold = (simpleEarnIncome + knownCost) / hedgedShortNotional.\n\nNote that in the existing code:\n- `simpleEarnIncome = candidateCapital × apr × termDays /365` using DECIMAL128 MathContext.\n- `knownCost = costs.knownTotal()`.\n- `fundingIncome = hedgedShortNotional × holdingReturn`.\n\nThe threshold = (simpleEarnIncome + knownCost) / hedgedShortNotional. This is the cumulative90-day funding rate at which fundingIncome − knownCost = simpleEarnIncome, i.e. net income = simpleEarnIncome (delta =0). This matches AC-1.\n\nAvailability conditions per AC-3: same as when `incrementalIncomeVsSimpleEarn` is present — i.e., only when there are no blockers and no unknowns (netIncome/incremental are computed only in the final `else` branch). So the threshold should be Optional and only present when evidence allows exact same-basis net comparison: costs complete (no unknowns), terms confirmed (no blocker), settlements exist (no blocker), terminal policy exit-to-usdt (no unknown). Illegal/zero notional rejected by PhaseOneAssessmentRequest validation (hedgedShortNotional must be >0) — existing behavior.\n\nFiles in scope (~6):\n1. `src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/application/PhaseOneAssessmentService.java` — compute threshold, add to typed result.\n2. `src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessment.java` — add typed field `Optional<BigDecimal> breakEvenFundingRateThreshold` (or similar).\n3. `src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunner.java` — print the threshold with clear label \"90天累计资金费率阈值\" and unavailable case.\n4. `src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java` — service tests: sample, boundary (0.019/0.020/0.021 increments), zero cost, zero APR, negative funding rate, non-divisible precision, unavailable cases.\n5. `src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java` — CLI display tests: label present, unavailable case, no re-derivation.\n6. New doc: e.g. `docs/15-Funding-Rate-Break-Even-Threshold.md` — usage note with the sample and limitations.\n\nThat's exactly the \"现有服务、结果 record、CLI、两份测试和一份新说明，共约六个文件\" (existing service, result record, CLI, two tests, and one new doc — about six files total).\n\nLet me quickly check docs/09-Phase-1-Test-Runbook.md briefly to understand the doc conventions and where the new doc might best fit. Actually, the user says \"补充一份简明使用说明\" (add a concise usage note). A new doc file. Given docs/ has numbered files01–14, a new doc would be docs/15-... . Let me peek at the docs README to confirm the numbering and also check CLAUDE.md for project conventions regarding regression commands (AC-5 mentions non-container regression and Gate full baseline regression). Let me read CLAUDE.md to know the test commands.","signature":null}},{"ToolUse":{"id":"call_e66a7a7e7e7543f0adb6d72f","name":"Read CLAUDE.md","raw_input":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/CLAUDE.md\"}","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/CLAUDE.md"},"is_input_complete":true,"thought_signature":null}},{"Thinking":{"text":"I have a good understanding of the project. Now let me check the docs numbering for a new doc — docs/README.md mentions numbered docs01-14. A new doc would be `docs/15-Funding-Rate-Break-Even-Threshold.md` or similar. Let me quickly glance at docs/README.md's doc list to confirm the pattern and also look at docs/09 briefly for the \"独立验算\" (independent verification) pattern mentioned in AC-2 \"独立样例\" — actually the AC says \"AC-2独立样例与边界\". The docs/09 runbook includes独立验算 guidance. The new doc is \"一份新说明\" (a new usage note). Let me not read more; the scope is clear enough.\n\nLet me now also verify the precision approach in existing code: `simpleEarnIncome` uses `divide(DAYS_PER_YEAR, CALCULATION_CONTEXT)` with DECIMAL128. Threshold = (simpleEarnIncome + knownCost) / hedgedShortNotional. Division precision should be defined explicitly. AC-1 says \"计算使用 BigDecimal，精度规则明确\" — so we specify: use MathContext.DECIMAL128 consistent with existing service, and the threshold is a cumulative rate over the whole90-day window, no per-settlement or8h conversion.\n\nAC-2 numbers verified:\n- simpleEarnIncome =20000 ×0.0365 ×90/365 =180 exactly (20000×0.0365 =730;730×90 =65700;65700/365 =180).\n- threshold = (180+20)/10000 =0.02 exactly.\n- increments: r=0.019 → net=190−20=170, delta=170−180=−10; r=0.020 → delta0; r=0.021 → +10. ✓AC-3: threshold only available when existing assessment permits exact same-basis net comparison — in current code that's when `incrementalIncomeVsSimpleEarn` is present, i.e., no blockers and no unknowns (termsConfirmed, non-empty settlements, exit-to-usdt, complete costs). Otherwise unavailable with existing blockers/unknowns reasons; never0 or guessed. Illegal/zero notional: rejected by PhaseOneAssessmentRequest validation (hedgedShortNotional must be >0) — unchanged.\n\nAC-4: service produces typed result (add field to PhaseOneAssessment record, e.g. `Optional<BigDecimal> breakEvenFundingRateThreshold`); CLI only prints it labeled \"90天累计资金费率阈值\" and \"不可用\" case; no recomputation in CLI. Plus a concise usage doc with the sample and limitations. Existing recommendation, first-micro-validation cap (5000), costs, and risk semantics unchanged.\n\nAC-5: implement on fixed isolated baseline (current branch codex/w09-okx-break-even-20261026, commit7c5facc); service/CLI tests, existing non-container regression and Gate-required full baseline regression kept passing; executed tests observed/reported by program tooling (e.g. Maven surefire reports), not model prose. Full E2E completion still requires delivery approval, precise candidate application, human (or explicitly delegated) commit, and original finalize.\n\nScope files (6):\n1. src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/application/PhaseOneAssessmentService.java (MODIFY)\n2. src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessment.java (MODIFY)\n3. src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunner.java (MODIFY)\n4. src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java (MODIFY)\n5. src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java (MODIFY)\n6. docs/15-Funding-Rate-Break-Even-Threshold.md (CREATE — new doc; name choice is a proposal)\n\nWait — do I need to double check whether a new record type is needed, e.g. a typed wrapper for the threshold with a label? The user says \"现有评估服务产生 typed 结果\" — the service produces typed results. Adding an `Optional<BigDecimal>` field to the `PhaseOneAssessment` record satisfies \"typed 结果\". Simplest compliant implementation. Record it in risk_areas as material note? It's fine.\n\nNon-container regression: which tests are non-container? PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest and AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest are plain unit tests (no Testcontainers). The user says \"既有非容器回归和 Gate 要求的完整基线回归保留并通过\" — existing non-container regression and Gate-required full baseline regression kept and passing. That's about test execution, not file changes. So scope files are the6.\n\nExcluded: trading/account, collection (sync), DB migrations, positi...","signature":null}},{"ToolUse":{"id":"call_52951f4a1b244f609581372b","name":"Read docs/09-Phase-1-Test-Runbook.md (1 - 60)","raw_input":"{\"file_path\":\"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/docs/09-Phase-1-Test-Runbook.md\",\"limit\":60}","input":{"file_path":"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree/docs/09-Phase-1-Test-Runbook.md","limit":60},"is_input_complete":true,"thought_signature":null}},{"Thinking":{"text":"I have all the evidence I need. The docs are numbered01–14; a new doc would be `docs/15-...md`. The runbook confirms the baseline regression convention (`mvn test`, surefire reports).\n\nNow produce the final JSON artifact with all Chinese human-readable values.","signature":null}},{"Text":"{\n \"schema_version\" :1,\n \"workstream_id\" : \"ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA\",\n \"run_id\" : \"run-1793026771764\",\n \"node_id\" : \"intake.claude_brainstorm\",\n \"result\" : {\n \"artifact_type\" : \"task_contract_proposal\",\n \"decision\" : \"READY_FOR_PRODUCT_REVIEW\",\n \"summary\" : \"在既有 assess-income phase-one评估中由服务层计算并 typed输出追平简单赚币的90 天累计资金费率阈值，CLI 只展示，配套独立样例测试与简明使用说明。\",\n \"needs_human_input\" : false,\n \"objective\" : \"在既有 Java 项目 assess-income phase-one 的90 天历史情景评估中新增可解释指标：在相同90 天窗口、投入资金、对冲空头名义金额和固定已知成本口径下，资金费净收入追平简单赚币所需的整个90 天累计资金费率阈值，由 PhaseOneAssessmentService 计算、PhaseOneAssessment record承载、CLI 只读展示，并保留证据不足时的不可用语义。\",\n \"scope\" : {\n \"included\" : [ {\n \"path\" : \"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/application/PhaseOneAssessmentService.java\"\n }, {\n \"path\" : \"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessment.java\"\n }, {\n \"path\" : \"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunner.java\"\n }, {\n \"path\" : \"src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java\"\n }, {\n \"path\" : \"src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java\"\n }, {\n \"path\" : \"docs/15-Funding-Rate-Break-Even-Threshold.md\"\n } ],\n \"excluded\" : [ \"不修改交易/账户、采集（sync-market/sync-product）、数据库迁移、持仓、调度、组合策略、Web 页面、Dual 生产代码或客户端配置\", \"不接入任何新外部服务，不做未来费率预测或交易建议\", \"不做整个项目的公式重构，不新增平台、规则 DSL 或兼容机制\" ]\n },\n \"acceptance_criteria\" : [ {\n \"id\" : \"AC-1\",\n \"text\" : \"计算口径：阈值 =（既有简单赚币90 天收入 + 同口径完整已知成本）/ 对冲空头名义金额；该值是整个90 天窗口的累计资金费率，不是 APR，不得按每次结算或假定8 小时间隔换算；成本沿用 SmartArbitrageCosts.knownTotal()既有口径，不重复计费；计算使用 BigDecimal 且精度规则明确（与既有服务的 DECIMAL128计算上下文一致，除法精度显式声明）。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"AC-2\",\n \"text\" : \"独立样例与边界：共同资金20,000 USDT、简单赚币 APR0.0365、90 天、完整成本20 USDT、对冲名义10,000 USDT 时，对照收益为180 USDT、阈值为0.02（2%）；累计费率分别为0.019、0.020、0.021 时，现有同口径增量分别为 -10、0、10 USDT；测试同时覆盖零已知成本、零 APR、负资金费率以及不能整除的精度场景；不得用舍入后的 CLI 数字重新决定现有建议。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"AC-3\",\n \"text\" : \"证据不足：只在现有评估允许同口径精确净收入比较时提供数值；成本缺失、简单赚币条款未确认、窗口内无历史结算或期末保持策略开放时数值不可用，并沿既有阻断项/未知项说明原因，不得填0、猜数或给出可行动的精确阈值；非法或零名义金额沿 PhaseOneAssessmentRequest既有输入校验拒绝（hedgedShortNotional必须大于0）。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"AC-4\",\n \"text\" : \"唯一生产与展示：现有评估服务产生 typed 结果（阈值作为 PhaseOneAssessment 的字段），CLI 只消费该结果，清楚标注“90 天累计资金费率阈值”及不可用情况，不自行重算；补充一份简明中文使用说明，包含上述样例和限制；既有建议、首次小额验证上限（5,000 USDT）、成本和风险语义不变。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"AC-5\",\n \"text\" : \"回归与交付：在固定隔离基线（当前分支 codex/w09-okx-break-even-20261026 @7c5facc）上实现；相关服务/CLI测试、既有非容器回归和 Gate 要求的完整基线回归保留并通过，执行测试有程序工具观察和报告依据（如 Maven Surefire报告），不能只以模型“已通过”正文作数；独立验收完成后，仍需当前交付批准、精确候选应用、人工或另行明确委派的 commit、原 finalize，才能称完整 E2E 完成。\"\n } ],\n \"test_requirements\" : [ {\n \"id\" : \"TR-1\",\n \"text\" : \"PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest增加阈值单元测试：验证 AC-2样例（对照收益180 USDT、阈值0.02）与累计费率0.019/0.020/0.021 对应既有同口径增量 -10/0/+10 USDT，并覆盖零已知成本、零 APR、负资金费率和除不尽的精度场景；断言基于 BigDecimal原值而非 CLI舍入输出。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"TR-2\",\n \"text\" : \"PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest增加不可用与校验测试：成本缺失、条款未确认、无历史结算、期末保持策略开放时阈值为空且原因沿既有 blockers/unknowns输出；非法或零对冲名义金额在读取事实前被既有请求校验拒绝。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"TR-3\",\n \"text\" : \"AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest增加展示测试：完整证据时输出含“90 天累计资金费率阈值”标签及数值，证据不足时输出不可用说明且不打印数值；既有建议文案、首次实盘上限、退出码与限制提示不回归。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"TR-4\",\n \"text\" : \"在固定隔离基线上运行既有非容器回归和 Gate 要求的完整基线回归（mvn测试），以 Maven/Surefire等程序工具生成的报告作为通过依据，并保留完整基线通过事实。\"\n } ],\n \"constraints\" : [ {\n \"id\" : \"C-1\",\n \"text\" : \"继续使用现有 Java、BigDecimal、PhaseOneAssessmentService评估服务和 assess-income CLI，不接入任何新外部服务或数据源。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"C-2\",\n \"text\" : \"阈值是整个90 天窗口的累计资金费率，禁止换算成 APR 或按每次结算/假定8 小时间隔折算；资金费间隔遵循实际 fundingTime。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"C-3\",\n \"text\" : \"成本口径沿用 SmartArbitrageCosts.knownTotal()既有实现，不重复计费、不改变未知成本按 UNKNOWN处理的语义；阈值的可用条件与既有增量比较的可用条件一致。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"C-4\",\n \"text\" : \"单一生产来源：阈值只在 PhaseOneAssessmentService 内计算并作为 typed 字段返回；CLI 是薄适配层，只打印该结果，不重算、不用舍入值影响建议。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"C-5\",\n \"text\" : \"资金费事实表、数据库迁移、同步/回补、组合策略与 Web输出保持不动（只读）；新增说明文档为中文，沿用 docs 目录编号惯例。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"C-6\",\n \"text\" : \"精度规则显式：服务层计算与既有 CALCULATION_CONTEXT（MathContext.DECIMAL128）一致且除法上下文明确，展示层沿用 CLI既有格式化惯例并标注为累计费率而非年化。\"\n } ],\n \"non_goals\" : [ {\n \"id\" : \"NG-1\",\n \"text\" : \"不做未来资金费率预测、完整套利收益保证或交易建议；阈值仅用于历史情景比较，既有未覆盖风险与历史完整性限制继续保留。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"NG-2\",\n \"text\" : \"不修改交易/账户、采集、数据库迁移、持仓、调度、组合策略、Web 页面、Dual 生产代码或客户端配置。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"NG-3\",\n \"text\" : \"不把收益阈值推广为整个项目的公式重构，不新增平台、规则 DSL 或兼容机制。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"NG-4\",\n \"text\" : \"不改变既有建议逻辑、首次小额验证上限（5,000 USDT）、成本与风险/限制提示语义。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"NG-5\",\n \"text\" : \"发现实现依赖超出上述范围（如需要改迁移、Web 或组合代码）时停止并提交取舍，不擅自扩大实现。\"\n } ],\n \"risk_areas\" : [ {\n \"id\" : \"R-1\",\n \"text\" : \"阈值展示格式（小数位/百分比）需要在设计评审确定，避免被误读为 APR 或单次费率；服务层核心值保持 DECIMAL128 不预先舍入。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"R-2\",\n \"text\" : \"为 PhaseOneAssessment record 新增字段会改变构造签名，当前构造点仅在 PhaseOneAssessmentService，需在执行时确认无其他调用点遗漏。\"\n }, {\n \"id\" : \"R-3\",\n \"text\" : \"新说明文档建议命名 docs/15-Funding-Rate-Break-Even-Threshold.md（沿用 docs01–14 编号惯例），最终路径以 EXECUTION批准的精确 scope 为准。\"\n } ],\n \"evidence_refs\" : [ \"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/application/PhaseOneAssessmentService.java\", \"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessment.java\", \"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/PhaseOneAssessmentRequest.java\", \"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/domain/SmartArbitrageCosts.java\", \"src/main/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunner.java\", \"src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/assessment/PhaseOneAssessmentServiceTest.java\", \"src/test/java/app/cryptoincome/cli/AssessIncomeCliRunnerTest.java\", \"docs/09-Phase-1-Test-Runbook.md\" ],\n \"open_questions\" : [ ],\n \"revision_responses\" : [ ],\n \"base_proposal_id\" : null\n  }\n}"}],"tool_results":{"call_65911bb9ee294d9b8cada1df":{"tool_use_id":"call_65911bb9ee294d9b8cada1df","tool_name":"Read .agent/workstreams/ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA/artifacts/context-governance/occurrences/node-intake-claude_brainstorm-002-run-1793026771764/repo-map.json","is_error":false,"content":{"Text":"1\t{\n2\t  \"schemaVersion\" : 1,\n3\t  \"artifactType\" : \"repo_map\",\n4\t  \"workstreamId\" : \"ws-20261026T142203Z-7SNA\",\n5\t  \"generatedAt\" : \"2026-10-26T14:59:31.812704Z\",\n6\t  \"effectiveWorkdir\" : \"/Users/kriswang/work/projects/ai/codex-claude-ai-workflow/dual-orchestrator/output/w09-okx-next-e2e-gate-20261026/fixture/case/worktree\",\n7\t  \"baseCommit\" : \"\",\n8\t  \"source\" : \"git_tracked_inventory\",\n9\t  \"inventoryHe